node_modules
dist
# dist is excluded — the image builds from source in-container. The Dockerfile
# `final` stage copies /app/dist produced by the `builder` stage's `vite build`,
# never from the host. This keeps the build reproducible and immune to a stale
# or missing host dist/ (the prior host-prebuilt workaround caused blank
# capability-console routes and other stale-bundle symptoms on CI / other machines).
.git
*.sqlite3
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.env
.DS_Store
audit_reports
*.md
!README.md
